\* All TLC check configs for AntflyHAStandbyApply.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
\* TLC config for AntflyHAStandbyApply.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyApplyFailureAdvances = FALSE
    BuggyDuplicateEffect = FALSE
    BuggyCrashLosesReceive = FALSE
    BuggyClientWrite = FALSE
    BuggyBackgroundRuntime = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    ProgressOrder
    FailedApplyDoesNotAdvance
    ReplicatedApplyIsIdempotent
    DurableReceiveSurvivesCrash
    ClientWritesRejectedOnStandby
    MutatingRuntimeSuppressedOnStandby
    Safety

==== BadBackgroundRuntime
\* Expected-failure config: standby starts a mutating background runtime.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyApplyFailureAdvances = FALSE
    BuggyDuplicateEffect = FALSE
    BuggyCrashLosesReceive = FALSE
    BuggyClientWrite = FALSE
    BuggyBackgroundRuntime = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    MutatingRuntimeSuppressedOnStandby

==== BadClientWrite
\* Expected-failure config: standby accepts a client write.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyApplyFailureAdvances = FALSE
    BuggyDuplicateEffect = FALSE
    BuggyCrashLosesReceive = FALSE
    BuggyClientWrite = TRUE
    BuggyBackgroundRuntime = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    ClientWritesRejectedOnStandby

==== BadCrashLosesReceive
\* Expected-failure config: crash/reopen loses durable received WAL progress.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyApplyFailureAdvances = FALSE
    BuggyDuplicateEffect = FALSE
    BuggyCrashLosesReceive = TRUE
    BuggyClientWrite = FALSE
    BuggyBackgroundRuntime = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    DurableReceiveSurvivesCrash

==== BadDuplicateEffect
\* Expected-failure config: duplicate replicated apply replays side effects even
\* though the HA marker already covers the record.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyApplyFailureAdvances = FALSE
    BuggyDuplicateEffect = TRUE
    BuggyCrashLosesReceive = FALSE
    BuggyClientWrite = FALSE
    BuggyBackgroundRuntime = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    ReplicatedApplyIsIdempotent

==== BadFailureAdvances
\* Expected-failure config: failed apply advances applied/safe/marker progress.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyApplyFailureAdvances = TRUE
    BuggyDuplicateEffect = FALSE
    BuggyCrashLosesReceive = FALSE
    BuggyClientWrite = FALSE
    BuggyBackgroundRuntime = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    FailedApplyDoesNotAdvance
